DocuGuard-Server/.env
DocuGuard-Server/config/serviceAccountKey.json

TypeScript

*.tsbuildinfo

Generated native folders

# ios/ is not tracked in this repository, so excluding it costs nothing.
#
# android/ is deliberately NOT excluded: it is a bare project with 48 tracked
# files including gradlew, and the release APK workflow builds it directly.
# Removing it from the upload would leave EAS with no native project to build.
/ios